#: docs/.vitepress/i18n.json#a2uiCatalog.versioningDescription
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:a2uiCatalog.versioningDescription"
msgid "The v1 catalog ID is stable. Adding an optional component, property, or enum value is additive; removing or renaming an existing component or property, narrowing an enum, or making an optional property required is breaking and requires a new catalog version. Only the components and properties listed above are part of Pantoken's A2UI catalog."
msgstr "v1 型錄 ID 固定不變。新增選填元件、屬性或列舉值屬於向後相容的增補；移除或重新命名現有元件或屬性、縮小列舉範圍，或將選填屬性改為必填，則屬於重大變更，必須使用新的型錄版本。只有上方列出的元件與屬性屬於 Pantoken 的 A2UI 型錄。"

#: docs/.vitepress/i18n.json#a2uiCatalog.versioningActions
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:a2uiCatalog.versioningActions"
msgid "The catalog defines no executable functions and does not authorize actions. A2UI actions are dispatched through the host application's normal action handling, where the application must enforce its own permissions."
msgstr "此型錄未定義可執行函式，也不授權任何動作。A2UI 動作會透過主機應用程式的一般動作處理機制派發，應用程式必須在該處執行自己的權限控管。"

